=== module dialogue ===

== elder_start ==
Elder Mara: "The caravan vanished near the old mine. Take Ren if he will go."
->->

== apothecary_start ==
Apothecary Senn: "Bring moonleaf from the forest and I will brew an antidote."
->->

== ren_join ==
Ren checks the village gate and joins the party.
->->

== ren_scouts ==
Ren leaves the road to scout the mine gate alone.
->->

== ren_returns ==
Ren returns with chalk marks from the gate: sun, star, moon.
->->

== caravan_rescue ==
The caravan crew crawls from the mine lift, shaken but alive.
Ren: "Next time we send two scouts."
Lio: "Next time we bring a map."
->->

== ending ==
Elder Mara marks the caravan rescued and closes the village ledger.
Apothecary Senn trades the moonleaf for the promised cure.
->->
